s":["H3820"],"a":[11]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":9,"text":"For all of them tried to frighten us, thinking, Their hands will be weakened from working, and it will not be done. But now strengthen my hands!","tok":[{"t":"For all of them tried to frighten us, thinking, Their "},{"t":"hands","s":["H3027"],"a":[6]},{"t":" will be "},{"t":"weakened","s":["H7503"],"a":[5]},{"t":" from "},{"t":"working","s":["H4399"],"a":[8]},{"t":", and it will not be "},{"t":"done","s":["H6213"],"a":[10]},{"t":". But now "},{"t":"strengthen","s":["H2388"],"a":[12]},{"t":" my "},{"t":"hands","s":["H3027"],"a":[14]},{"t":"!"}]},{"n":10,"text":"And I went to the house of Shemaiah the son of Delaiah, the son of Mehetabel, who had shut himself up. And he said, Let us meet together in the house of God, within the temple; and let us shut the doors of the temple, for they are coming to slay you; indeed at night they are coming to slay you.","tok":[{"t":"And I went to the "},{"t":"house","s":["H1004"],"a":[2]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Shemaiah","s":["H8098"],"a":[3]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"son","s":["H1121"],"a":[4]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Delaiah","s":["H1806"],"a":[5]},{"t":", the "},{"t":"son","s":["H1121"],"a":[6]},{"t":" of Mehetabel, who had shut himself "},{"t":"up","s":["H6113"],"a":[9]},{"t":". And he "},{"t":"said","s":["H0559"],"a":[10]},{"t":", Let us meet "},{"t":"together","s":["H3259"],"a":[11]},{"t":" in the "},{"t":"house","s":["H1004"],"a":[13]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[14]},{"t":", "},{"t":"within","s":["H8432"],"a":[16]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"temple","s":["H1964"],"a":[17]},{"t":"; and let us "},{"t":"shut","s":["H5462"],"a":[18]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"doors","s":["H1817"],"a":[19]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"temple","s":["H1964"],"a":[20]},{"t":", for they are "},{"t":"coming","s":["H0935"],"a":[22]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"slay","s":["H2026"],"a":[23]},{"t":" you; indeed at "},{"t":"night","s":["H3915"],"a":[24]},{"t":" they are "},{"t":"coming","s":["H0935"],"a":[25]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"slay","s":["H2026"],"a":[26]},{"t":" you."}]},{"n":11,"text":"But I said, Should a man like me flee? And who, being like me, would go into the temple to save his life? I will not go in.","tok":[{"t":"But I "},{"t":"said","s":["H0559"],"a":[0]},{"t":", "},{"t":"Should","s":["H3644"],"a":[2]},{"t":" a "},{"t":"man","s":["H0376"],"a":[1]},{"t":" like me "},{"t":"flee","s":["H1272"],"a":[3]},{"t":"? And who, being like me, would "},{"t":"go","s":["H0935"],"a":[7]},{"t":" into the "},{"t":"temple","s":["H1964"],"a":[9]},{"t":" to save his "},{"t":"life","s":["H2425"]},{"t":"? I will not go "},{"t":"in","s":["H0935"],"a":[12]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":12,"text":"Then I perceived that surely God had not sent him but that he spoke this prophecy against me and that Tobiah and Sanballat had hired him.","tok":[{"t":"Then I "},{"t":"perceived","s":["H5234"],"a":[0]},{"t":" that surely "},{"t":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[3]},{"t":" had not "},{"t":"sent","s":["H7971"],"a":[4]},{"t":" him but that he spoke this "},{"t":"prophecy","s":["H5016"],"a":[6]},{"t":" against me and that "},{"t":"Tobiah","s":["H2900"],"a":[9]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"Sanballat","s":["H5571"],"a":[10]},{"t":" had "},{"t":"hired","s":["H7936"],"a":[11]},{"t":" him."}]},{"n":13,"text":"He had been hired for this reason, that I would be frightened and that I would act in such a way as to sin; then they would have cause for an evil report in order to reproach me.","tok":[{"t":"He had been "},{"t":"hired","s":["H7936"],"a":[1]},{"t":" for this reason, that I would be frightened and that I would act in such a way as to "},{"t":"sin","s":["H2398"],"a":[7]},{"t":"; then they would have cause for an "},{"t":"evil","s":["H7451"],"a":[11]},{"t":" "},{"t":"report","s":["H8034"],"a":[10]},{"t":" in order to "},{"t":"reproach","s":["H2778"],"a":[13]},{"t":" me."}]},{"n":14,"text":"Remember, O my God, Tobiah and Sanballat according to these works of theirs, and also the prophetess Noadiah and the rest of the prophets, who tried to frighten 